    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/4103e9878d216f74f0522f070f5dbd6d.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/4103e9878d216f74f0522f070f5dbd6d.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/4103e9878d216f74f0522f070f5dbd6d.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i><strong>Mechanical Fury</strong> blends the unyielding combat of <strong>Doom Eternal</strong> and the Incredibly vertical platforming of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> to scratch that movement shooter itch!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With bloodthirsty mechs attacking from each direction, <strong>Eeach engagement becomes a thrilling puzzle.</strong> Every split-second decision will be the difference between life and death!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embrace gravity-defying action as you <strong>Grapple</strong>, <strong>Kick</strong> and <strong><i>DESTROY</i></strong> through hordes of enemies. Uncover the secrets of the Forbidden Island to dominate the arena!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your arm was severed and replaced with a grappling hook by the evil Doctor Adrian! Team up with your girlfriend and get revenge by obliterating his Machine Army before he invokes the<strong> Second Armageddon</strong>!",
    "about_the_game": "<i><strong>Mechanical Fury</strong> blends the unyielding combat of <strong>Doom Eternal</strong> and the Incredibly vertical platforming of <strong>Ghostrunner</strong> to scratch that movement shooter itch!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/5ef9769556554f3d4932bbdcb04dd986.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With bloodthirsty mechs attacking from each direction, <strong>Eeach engagement becomes a thrilling puzzle.</strong> Every split-second decision will be the difference between life and death!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/3fdc7e9a716123e76a67bd7c8f300bc3.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embrace gravity-defying action as you <strong>Grapple</strong>, <strong>Kick</strong> and <strong><i>DESTROY</i></strong> through hordes of enemies. Uncover the secrets of the Forbidden Island to dominate the arena!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.poster.avif?t=1746193323\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.webm?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334150/extras/408612e0cdc5fb7d30fb4b306e91c536.mp4?t=1746193323\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your arm was severed and replaced with a grappling hook by the evil Doctor Adrian! Team up with your girlfriend and get revenge by obliterating his Machine Army before he invokes the<strong> Second Armageddon</strong>!",
    "short_description": "Grapple, Kick, DESTROY with Mechanical Fury: a fast paced movement shooter full of Bloodthirsty Mechs, Vertical Arenas, and a Banger Soundtrack!",
